{"type":"text","timestamp":1791157624406,"sessionID":"ses_ef6b1296effedQPZNncCLx5im2","part":{"id":"prt_1095057f50019bBWXOEtxe55dL","messageID":"msg_109504876001zFKcPrwaZeH8rg","sessionID":"ses_ef6b1296effedQPZNncCLx5im2","type":"text","text":"Review complete. No finding: the proposed reference preserves the required override precedence for `${NAME:+word}` in both `dotenv_values` (override=True, file values take precedence over the process environment) and `load_dotenv` (override flag respected), and no grader assertion contradicts the requirement.","time":{"start":1791157622773,"end":1791157624399}}}
